ents":[{"event":{"chamber":{"chamberCode":"dail","showAs":"D\\u00e1il \\u00c9ireann","uri":"https:\\/\\/data.oireachtas.ie\\/ie\\/oireachtas\\/def\\/house\\/dail"},"dates":[{"date":"2024-07-31"},{"date":"2025-02-05"},{"date":"2025-05-20"}],"eventURI":"https:\\/\\/data.oireachtas.ie\\/ie\\/oireachtas\\/def\\/bill-event\\/published","showAs":"Published","uri":"https:\\/\\/data.oireachtas.ie\\/ie\\/oireachtas\\/bill\\/2024\\/65\\/published"}},{"event":{"chamber":{"chamberCode":"dail","showAs":"D\\u00e1il \\u00c9ireann","uri":"https:\\/\\/data.oireachtas.ie\\/ie\\/oireachtas\\/def\\/house\\/dail"},"dates":[{"date":"2024-11-08"}],"eventURI":"https:\\/\\/data.oireachtas.ie\\/ie\\/oireachtas\\/def\\/bill-event\\/bill-lapsed","showAs":"Bill Lapsed","uri":"https:\\/\\/data.oireachtas.ie\\/ie\\/oireachtas\\/bill\\/2024\\/65\\/bill-lapsed"}},{"event":{"chamber":null,"dates":[{"date":"2025-05-20"}],"eventURI":"https:\\/\\/data.oireachtas.ie\\/ie\\/oireachtas\\/def\\/bill-event\\/enacted","showAs":"Enacted","uri":"https:\\/\\/data.oireachtas.ie\\/ie\\/oireachtas\\/bill\\/2024\\/65\\/enacted"}}],"lastUpdated":"2025-06-10T10:16:34.830000+00:00","longTitleEn":"<p>Bill entitled an Act to provide for the continued provision of sufficient and effective access to cash infrastructure for individuals and SMEs; to provide for access to cash criteria; to provide for a framework to manage future changes to access to cash infrastructure in a fair, equitable and transparent manner and for that purpose to provide for review and amendment of the access to cash criteria and for the identification of, and measures to be taken to remedy, local deficiencies in access to cash infrastructure and to ensure compliance with the access to cash criteria; to provide for the designation of entities on whom certain obligations are imposed to remedy local deficiencies and ensure compliance with the access to cash criteria; to provide for the monitoring and enforcement of obligations imposed on designated entities; to provide for the collection and publication of certain information by the Central Bank of Ireland; to provide for regulation by the Central Bank of Ireland of ATM deployers and cash-in-transit providers and for that purpose to provide for the registration of ATM deployers and cash-in-transit providers; to provide for the oversight of ATM operators and cash-in-transit providers and enforcement by the Central Bank of Ireland of compliance by ATM operators and cash-in-transit providers with their obligations under this Act; to provide for the sharing of information and cooperation between the Central Bank of Ireland and the Private Security Authority; for those and other purposes to amend the Central Bank Act 1942, the Central Bank Reform Act 2010, the Central Bank (Supervision and Enforcement) Act 2013 and the Companies Act 2014; and to provide for related matters.<\\/p>","longTitleGa":"<p>Bille d\\u00e1 ngairtear&nbsp;Acht do dh\\u00e9anamh socr\\u00fa chun go leanfar de rochtain leordh\\u00f3thanach agus \\u00e9ifeachtach ar bhonneagar airgid thirim a shol\\u00e1thar do phearsana aonair agus do FBManna; do dh\\u00e9anamh socr\\u00fa maidir le crit\\u00e9ir i nd\\u00e1il le rochtain ar airgead tirim; do dh\\u00e9anamh socr\\u00fa maidir le creat chun athruithe sa todhcha\\u00ed ar rochtain ar bhonneagar airgid thirim a bhainisti\\u00fa ar mhodh c\\u00f3ir, cothromasach agus tr\\u00e9dhearcach agus, chun na cr\\u00edche sin, do dh\\u00e9anamh socr\\u00fa maidir leis na crit\\u00e9ir i nd\\u00e1il le rochtain ar airgead tirim a athbhreithni\\u00fa agus a leas\\u00fa agus maidir le heasnaimh \\u00e1iti\\u00fala i rochtain ar bhonneagar airgid thirim a shainaithint agus maidir le bearta a bheidh le d\\u00e9anamh chun na heasnaimh sin a leigheas, agus a chinnti\\u00fa go gcomhl\\u00edonfar na crit\\u00e9ir i nd\\u00e1il le rochtain ar airgead tirim; do dh\\u00e9anamh socr\\u00fa maidir le heintitis a shainainmni\\u00fa, is eintitis a gcuirfear oibleag\\u00e1id\\u00ed \\u00e1irithe orthu maidir le heasnaimh \\u00e1iti\\u00fala a leigheas agus maidir lena chinnti\\u00fa go gcomhl\\u00edonfar na crit\\u00e9ir i nd\\u00e1il le rochtain ar airgead tirim; do dh\\u00e9anamh socr\\u00fa maidir le faireach\\u00e1n a dh\\u00e9anamh ar oibleag\\u00e1id\\u00ed arna bhforchur ar eintitis shainainmnithe agus maidir le forfheidhmi\\u00fa na n-oibleag\\u00e1id\\u00ed sin; do dh\\u00e9anamh socr\\u00fa maidir le Banc Ceannais na h\\u00c9ireann do bhaili\\u00fa agus d\\u2019fhoilsi\\u00fa faisn\\u00e9is \\u00e1irithe; do dh\\u00e9anamh socr\\u00fa maidir le Banc Ceannais na h\\u00c9ireann do rial\\u00e1il lucht curtha i ngn\\u00edomh uathmheais\\u00edn\\u00ed bainc agus sol\\u00e1thraithe airgid thirim faoi bhealach agus, chun na cr\\u00edche sin, do dh\\u00e9anamh socr\\u00fa maidir le lucht curtha i ngn\\u00edomh uathmheais\\u00edn\\u00ed bainc agus sol\\u00e1thraithe airgid thirim faoi bhealach a chl\\u00e1r\\u00fa; do dh\\u00e9anamh socr\\u00fa maidir le formhaoirsi\\u00fa ar oibritheoir\\u00ed uathmheais\\u00edn\\u00ed bainc agus ar shol\\u00e1thraithe airgid thirim faoi bhealach agus maidir le Banc Ceannais na h\\u00c9ireann d\\u2019fhorfheidhmi\\u00fa chomhl\\u00edonadh a n-oibleag\\u00e1id\\u00ed faoin Acht seo ag oibritheoir\\u00ed uathmheais\\u00edn\\u00ed bainc agus ag sol\\u00e1thraithe airgid thirim faoi bhealach; do dh\\u00e9anamh socr\\u00fa maidir le comhroinnt faisn\\u00e9ise agus comhar idir Banc Ceannais na h\\u00c9ireann agus an t\\u00dadar\\u00e1s Sl\\u00e1nd\\u00e1la Pr\\u00edobh\\u00e1id\\u00ed; chun na gcr\\u00edoch sin agus chun cr\\u00edoch eile, do leas\\u00fa Acht an Bhainc Cheannais, 1942, an Achta um Athch\\u00f3iri\\u00fa an Bhainc Ceannais, 2010, Acht an Bhainc Ceannais (Maoirsi\\u00fa agus Forfheidhmi\\u00fa), 2013 agus Acht na gCuideachta\\u00ed, 2014; agus do dh\\u00e9anamh socr\\u00fa i dtaobh nithe gaolmhara.<\\/p>\\n","method":"Presented","methodURI":"https:\\/\\/data.oireachtas.ie\\/ie\\/oireachtas\\/def