ng revoked by this Act, to assign citations to those instruments so as to facilitate their citation, to provide a means by which <i>prima facie<\\/i> evidence of certain instruments may be given, and to provide for related matters.<\\/p>","longTitleGa":"<p>Acht do dh\\u00e9anamh socr\\u00fa maidir leis an dl\\u00ed reacht\\u00fail a athch\\u00f3iri\\u00fa tr\\u00ed gach ionstraim a rinneadh roimh an 1 Ean\\u00e1ir 1861 a ch\\u00falghairm, seachas ionstraim\\u00ed \\u00e1irithe, do shainaithint na n-ionstraim\\u00ed sin nach bhfuil \\u00e1 gc\\u00falghairm leis an Acht seo, do shannadh luanna do na hionstraim\\u00ed sin d\\u2019fhonn a lua a \\u00e9asc\\u00fa, do shol\\u00e1thar me\\u00e1n tr\\u00edna bhf\\u00e9adfar fianaise <i>prima facie<\\/i> ar ionstraim\\u00ed \\u00e1irithe a thabhairt, agus do dh\\u00e9anamh socr\\u00fa i dtaobh nithe gaolmhara.<\\/p>","shortTitleEn":"Statute Law Revision Act 2025","shortTitleGa":"An tAcht um Athch\\u00f3iri\\u00fa an Dl\\u00ed Reacht\\u00fail, 2025","statutebookURI":"http:\\/\\/www.irishstatutebook.ie\\/eli\\/2025\\/act\\/10","uri":"https:\\/\\/data.oireachtas.ie\\/ie\\/oireachtas\\/act\\/2025\\/10"},"amendmentLists":[{"amendmentList":{"amendmentTypeUri":{"uri":"https:\\/\\/data.oireachtas.ie\\/ie\\/oireachtas\\/def\\/amendment-type\\/creamList"},"chamber":{"showAs":"Dail","uri":"https:\\/\\/data.oireachtas.ie\\/ie\\/oireachtas\\/def\\/dail"},"date":"2025-07-08","formats":{"pdf":{"uri":"https:\\/\\/data.oireachtas.ie\\/ie\\/oireachtas\\/bill\\/2024\\/78\\/dail\\/6\\/amendment\\/creamList\\/eng\\/b78a24s-cl.pdf"},"xml":null},"showAs":"Cream List [D\\u00e1il amendments to Seanad Bill]","stage":{"showAs":"Cream List","uri":"https:\\/\\/data.oireachtas.ie\\/ie\\/oireachtas\\/bill\\/2024\\/78\\/dail\\/6"},"stageNo":"6"}},{"amendmentList":{"amendmentTypeUri":{"uri":"https:\\/\\/data.oireachtas.ie\\/ie\\/oireachtas\\/def\\/amendment-type\\/numberedList"},"chamber":{"showAs":"Dail","uri":"https:\\/\\/data.oireachtas.ie\\/ie\\/oireach