nt made before 1 January 1861, to identify those instruments that are not being revoked by this Act, to assign citations to those instruments so as to facilitate their citation, to provide a means by which <i>prima facie<\\/i> evidence of certain instruments may be given, and to provide for related matters.<\\/p>","longTitleGa":"<p>Acht do dh\\u00e9anamh socr\\u00fa maidir leis an dl\\u00ed reacht\\u00fail a athch\\u00f3iri\\u00fa tr\\u00ed gach ionstraim a rinneadh roimh an 1 Ean\\u00e1ir 1861 a ch\\u00falghairm, seachas ionstraim\\u00ed \\u00e1irithe, do shainaithint na n-ionstraim\\u00ed sin nach bhfuil \\u00e1 gc\\u00falghairm leis an Acht seo, do shannadh luanna do na hionstraim\\u00ed sin d\\u2019fhonn a lua a \\u00e9asc\\u00fa, do shol\\u00e1thar me\\u00e1n tr\\u00edna bhf\\u00e9adfar fianaise <i>prima facie<\\/i> ar ionstraim\\u00ed \\u00e1irithe a thabhairt, agus do dh\\u00e9anamh socr\\u00fa i dtaobh nithe gaolmhara.<\\/p>","method":"Presented","methodURI":"https:\\/\\/data.oireachtas.ie\\/ie\\/oireachtas\\/def\\/bill-method\\/presented","mostRecentStage":{"event":{"chamber":null,"dates":[{"date":"2025-07-23"}],"house":null,"progressStage":11,"showAs":"Enacted","stageCompleted":true,"stageOutcome":"Enacted","stageURI":"https:\\/\\/data.oireachtas.ie\\/ie\\/oireachtas\\/def\\/bill-stage\\/enacted","uri":"https:\\/\\/data.oireachtas.ie\\/ie\\/oireachtas\\/bill\\/2024\\/78\\/stage\\/oireachtas\\/enacted"}},"originHouse":{"showAs":"Seanad \\u00c9ireann","uri":"https:\\/\\/data.oireachtas.ie\\/ie\\/oireachtas\\/def\\/house\\/seanad"},"originHouseURI":"https:\\/\\/data.oireachtas.ie\\/ie\\/oireachtas\\/def\\/house\\/seanad","relatedDocs":[{"relatedDoc":{"date":"2025-03-25","docType":"gluais","formats":{"pdf":{"uri":"https:\\/\\/data.oireachtas.ie\\/ie\\/oireachtas\\/bill\\/2024\\/78\\/mul\\/gluais\\/gluais-03-2025-an-bille-um-athchoiriu-an-dli-reachtuil-2024.pdf"},"xml":null},"lang":"mul","showAs":"Glossary\\/Gluais","uri":"https:\\/\\/data.oireachtas.ie\\/ie\\/