15:17:03.040000+00:00","longTitleEn":"<p>Bill entitled an Act to provide for the dissolution of the Marine Casualty Investigation Board and for its replacement with a unit within the Department of Transport to be known as the Marine Accident Investigation Unit; to provide for the investigation and reporting of marine accidents; to repeal the Merchant Shipping (Investigation of Marine Casualties) Act 2000; to provide for the regulation of offshore service vessels; for those and other purposes to amend the Merchant Shipping (Safety Convention) Act 1952, the Merchant Shipping Act 1992 and the Merchant Shipping Act 2010; and to provide for related matters.<\\/p>","longTitleGa":"<p>Bille d\\u00e1 ngairtear Acht do dh\\u00e9anamh socr\\u00fa chun an Bord um Thaism\\u00ed Muir\\u00ed a Imscr\\u00fad\\u00fa a dh\\u00edscaoileadh agus chun aonad laistigh den Roinn Iompair ar a dtabharfar an tAonad um Imscr\\u00fad\\u00fa Tion\\u00f3isc\\u00ed Muir\\u00ed a chur ina ionad; do dh\\u00e9anamh socr\\u00fa maidir le tion\\u00f3isc\\u00ed muir\\u00ed a imscr\\u00fad\\u00fa agus a thuairisci\\u00fa; d\\u2019aisghairm an Achta Loingis Cheanna\\u00edochta (Taism\\u00ed Muir\\u00ed a Imscr\\u00fad\\u00fa), 2000; do dh\\u00e9anamh socr\\u00fa maidir le rial\\u00e1il a dh\\u00e9anamh ar \\u00e1rtha\\u00ed seirbh\\u00edse amach \\u00f3n gc\\u00f3sta; chun na gcr\\u00edoch sin agus chun cr\\u00edoch eile, do leas\\u00fa an Achta Loingis Cheanna\\u00edochta (Coinbhinsi\\u00fan S\\u00e1bh\\u00e1ltachta), 1952, an Achta Loingis Cheanna\\u00edochta, 1992 agus an Achta Loingis Cheanna\\u00edochta, 2010; agus do dh\\u00e9anamh socr\\u00fa i dtaobh nithe gaolmhara.<\\/p>","method":"Presented","methodURI":"https:\\/\\/data.oireachtas.ie\\/ie\\/oireachtas\\/def\\/bill-method\\/presented","mostRecentStage":{"event":{"chamber":null,"dates":[{"date":"2025-04-14"}],"house":null,"progressStage":10,"showAs":"Enacted","stageCompleted":true,"stageOutcome":"Enacted","stageURI":"https:\\/\\/data.oireachtas.